      "versionNonce": 1182946,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788006000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ESP32-S3 N16R8\n\nStart button: GPIO4\n\nBNO08x SPI: 19, 20, 21, 47, 48\nBNO08x RST: 2    WAKE: 38\n\nMPU6050 I2C: SDA8, SCL9\n\nToF I2C: SDA5, SCL6\nToF XSHUT: 15, 39, 40, 41, 42\n\nK230 UART: TX17, RX18\n\nIBT-2: EN10, RPWM11, LPWM12\n\nSteering signal: GPIO13\n\nDiagnostic firmware keeps\nmotor and steering outputs LOW.",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ESP32-S3 N16R8\n\nStart button: GPIO4\n\nBNO08x SPI: 19, 20, 21, 47, 48\nBNO08x RST: 2    WAKE: 38\n\nMPU6050 I2C: SDA8, SCL9\n\nToF I2C: SDA5, SCL6\nToF XSHUT: 15, 39, 40, 41, 42\n\nK230 UART: TX17, RX18\n\nIBT-2: EN10, RPWM11, LPWM12\n\nSteering signal: GPIO13\n\nDiagnostic firmware keeps\nmotor and steering outputs LOW.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
